## Next Planned Architectural Step

Build an orchestration service connecting:

```text
Collector
→ CollectorRun
→ RawEventOdds
→ validation
→ normalization
→ matching
→ MarketIdentity
→ OddsSnapshot
→ storage
→ freshness
→ analysis
```

This will be the first complete ingestion workflow.

---

## Rule

> The engine should detect anomalies in the domain, not anomalies introduced by bad parsing, stale observations, inconsistent formats, or incorrect matching.
